Subject: [PATCH net 08/11] netfilter: nft_ct: drop pending enqueued packets on removal
Date: Fri, 13 Mar 2026 16:06:11 +0100
Message-ID: <20260313150614.21177-9-fw@strlen.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.52.0
